WEBVTT

00:11.619 --> 00:13.515
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

00:13.515 --> 00:15.929
Bonjour, Mademoiselle Sandy.
你好，桑迪小姐。

00:15.929 --> 00:17.619
I have brought your usual,
我带来了你平常的，

00:17.619 --> 00:19.619
one Krusty Kombo.
一份 Krusty Kombo。

00:19.619 --> 00:20.757
Thanks, SpongeBob.
谢谢，海绵宝宝。

00:20.757 --> 00:22.446
But I won't
be needing the food.
但我不会
需要食物。

00:22.446 --> 00:25.377
I brought a little something
of my own from home...
我带了一点东西
我自己从家里...

00:25.377 --> 00:28.550
<i>From home,
from home, from home.</i>
<i>从家里，
从家里，从家里。</i>

00:28.550 --> 00:30.894
Sandy's smokin' barbecue nuts!
桑迪的烧烤坚果！

00:30.894 --> 00:33.170
I see nothing!
我什么也没看见！

00:35.688 --> 00:38.998
There is no outside food
allowed at the Krusty Krab.
没有外面的食物
蟹堡王允许。

00:38.998 --> 00:40.653
Come on, SpongeBob.
来吧，海绵宝宝。

00:40.653 --> 00:43.239
I won't spill the nuts
if you won't.
我不会把坚果洒出来
如果你不这样做。

00:50.860 --> 00:52.791
Mmm.
嗯。

00:52.791 --> 00:54.343
Perfecto!
完美！

00:54.343 --> 00:56.170
I haven't seen a thing.
我什么也没看到。

00:56.170 --> 00:57.343
Try one.
尝试一个。

00:57.343 --> 00:58.963
Mm.
Ooh...
毫米。
哦...

00:58.963 --> 01:00.791
wh...
什...

01:06.032 --> 01:07.239
Hm?
嗯？

01:07.239 --> 01:09.067
Whoo!
Now that's what I call
呼！
现在这就是我所说的

01:09.067 --> 01:10.688
Texas heat!
德克萨斯州炎热！

01:10.688 --> 01:13.757
But we really should stop
before Mr. Krabs finds out.
但我们真的应该停下来
在蟹老板发现之前。

01:13.757 --> 01:14.757
Hm?
嗯？

01:14.757 --> 01:16.239
Hmm.
唔。

01:16.239 --> 01:17.722
Finds out what?
发现了什么？

01:17.722 --> 01:18.826
Yikes!
哎呀！

01:18.826 --> 01:20.343
Oh, uh, hi, Mr. Krabs.
哦，呃，嗨，蟹老板。

01:27.757 --> 01:30.446
Outside food!
外面的食物！

01:30.446 --> 01:33.170
Oh, mercy, Mr. Krabs!
哦，天哪，蟹老板！

01:33.170 --> 01:35.308
She knows not
the error of her ways!
她不知道
她的做法是错误的！

01:35.308 --> 01:36.412
Oh, please.
哦，拜托。

01:36.412 --> 01:38.308
I bet one taste of these nuts
我打赌尝过这些坚果的味道

01:38.308 --> 01:40.136
and you'll whistle
a different tune!
你会吹口哨
不同的曲调！

01:40.136 --> 01:41.619
That's enough!
够了！

01:41.619 --> 01:45.688
I'm confiscerating
these unauthorized acorns.
我没收
这些未经授权的橡子。

01:46.757 --> 01:50.170
<i>Eh, what's so good about these
unauthorized nuts anyway?</i>
<i>呃，这些有什么好处
无论如何，未经授权的坚果？</i>

01:50.170 --> 01:51.550
<i>Hmm.</i>
<i>嗯。</i>

01:53.791 --> 01:55.688
All right!
好的！

01:55.688 --> 01:57.619
Sandy, you're hired!
桑迪，你被录用了！

01:57.619 --> 01:58.757
To do what?
做什么？

01:58.757 --> 02:00.205
Whoa!
哇！

02:00.205 --> 02:02.412
Why, to make those nuts
at me restaurant, of course.
为什么，要做那些坚果
当然是在我的餐厅。

02:02.412 --> 02:04.274
They're delicirous!
它们很好吃！

02:04.274 --> 02:07.101
Uh, you're a few pickles shy
of a Krabby Patty
呃，你有点害羞
蟹肉饼

02:07.101 --> 02:09.101
if you think
I'm looking for a job.
如果你认为
我正在找工作。

02:09.101 --> 02:11.722
Sandy, this is no mere job!
桑迪，这不仅仅是工作！

02:11.722 --> 02:13.757
This is a calling.
这是一个呼召。

02:13.757 --> 02:15.998
This is a duty to serve.
这是一种服务的义务。

02:15.998 --> 02:19.032
This is a dream come true.
这是梦想成真。

02:19.032 --> 02:22.308
Well, shoot!
Why not?
好吧，射击！
为什么不呢？

02:22.308 --> 02:24.170
But I'll need me
a barbecue grill.
但我需要我
烧烤架

02:24.170 --> 02:25.929
No problem.
没问题。

02:25.929 --> 02:29.791
I got an old Navy trick
for makeshift barbecues.
我有一个海军老把戏
用于临时烧烤。

02:29.791 --> 02:31.170
Ta-da!
哒哒！

02:33.412 --> 02:34.791
Not too shabby.
不太破旧。

02:34.791 --> 02:36.032
I reckon she'll do.
我想她会的。

02:36.032 --> 02:37.894
Make sure to show her
the ropes, boy-o!
一定要给她看
绳索，男孩哦！

02:38.894 --> 02:40.791
Barbecue nuts?
烧烤坚果？

02:40.791 --> 02:43.274
These customers will
eat anything.
这些客户将
吃任何东西。

02:44.550 --> 02:46.653
Mmm.
Nice aftertaste.
嗯。
回味不错。

02:48.032 --> 02:49.860
♪ Sandy's in the kitchen
with SpongeBob ♪
♪ 桑迪在厨房里
和海绵宝宝一起♪

02:49.860 --> 02:52.274
♪ We're in the kitchen,
we two ♪
♪ 我们在厨房里，
我们两个♪

02:52.274 --> 02:54.826
♪ Sandy's in the kitchen
with SpongeBob ♪
♪ 桑迪在厨房里
和海绵宝宝一起♪

02:54.826 --> 02:57.136
♪ Makin' nuts on the barbecue ♪
♪ 在烧烤上做坚果 ♪

02:57.136 --> 02:58.412
You heard the boss man.
你听到了老板的声音。

02:58.412 --> 03:00.239
Tell me what's what.
告诉我那是什么。

03:00.239 --> 03:02.826
Well, this here is
where the magic happens,
嗯，这里是
魔法发生的地方，

03:02.826 --> 03:04.894
the grill.
烤架。

03:04.894 --> 03:06.722
Yeow!
哟！

03:06.722 --> 03:09.377
As long as the sacred space
is respected,
只要神圣空间
受到尊重，

03:09.377 --> 03:12.205
the kitchen will remain
in perfect harmony.
厨房将保留
完美和谐。

03:12.205 --> 03:13.619
Not to worry!
不用担心！

03:13.619 --> 03:15.998
We'll be like two crickets
on a fiddle in here--
我们会像两只蟋蟀
在这里拉小提琴——

03:15.998 --> 03:17.412
Huh?
啊？

03:17.412 --> 03:19.619
Here.
Knock yourselves out,
这里。
把自己打垮，

03:19.619 --> 03:20.757
please.
请。

03:22.205 --> 03:23.205
Already on it!
已经开始了！

03:23.205 --> 03:24.860
So how many nuts
should I fix up?
那么有多少坚果
我应该修复吗？

03:24.860 --> 03:26.032
Nuts?
坚果？

03:26.032 --> 03:28.274
Oh, sorry, Sandy.
There must be a mistake.
哦，对不起，桑迪。
肯定弄错了。

03:28.274 --> 03:29.998
These are all
for Krabby Patties.
这些都是
蟹肉饼。

03:29.998 --> 03:31.412
- Oh.
- Don't worry!
- 哦。
- 不用担心！

03:31.412 --> 03:33.308
I'll get the word out!
我会把话说出来！

03:33.308 --> 03:34.894
Howdy, Bubble Bass!
你好，泡泡巴斯！

03:34.894 --> 03:38.757
I reckon you're hankering
for a delicious new dish!
我猜你正在渴望
一道美味的新菜！

03:38.757 --> 03:40.515
Certainly not.
当然不是。

03:40.515 --> 03:43.101
I procure
the same patty every day
我采购
每天都吃同样的馅饼

03:43.101 --> 03:45.239
because I have a refined--
因为我有一个精致的——

03:50.584 --> 03:51.894
Ooh!
哦！

03:51.894 --> 03:54.136
Such smoky sapidity.
如此烟熏味。

03:54.136 --> 03:55.377
What is it?
它是什么？

03:55.377 --> 03:58.412
Sandy's smokin'
barbecue nuts!
桑迪在抽烟
烧烤坚果！

03:58.412 --> 04:00.343
Pretty good, am I right?
很好，我说得对吗？

04:00.343 --> 04:02.515
Not just pretty good,
不仅表现得很好，

04:02.515 --> 04:05.101
but good enough to go on...
但足够继续下去了...

04:05.101 --> 04:07.757
the big screen!
大屏幕！

04:09.929 --> 04:13.170
"Try Sandy's smokin'
barbecue nuts."
“试试桑迪的抽烟”
烧烤坚果。”

04:13.170 --> 04:14.343
You hear that, everyone?
大家听到了吗？

04:14.343 --> 04:16.205
This guy's butt loves
those nuts!
这家伙的屁股真爱
那些疯子！

04:16.205 --> 04:17.929
I'll take some nuts!
我要吃点坚果！

04:17.929 --> 04:19.688
His butt's never wrong!
他的屁股永远不会错！

04:19.688 --> 04:21.826
- I want some!
- Me too!
- 我想要一些！
- 我也是！

04:21.826 --> 04:23.515
Ooh, nuts!
哦，疯了！

04:25.619 --> 04:27.412
Whoo, doggy!
哇，狗仔！

04:27.412 --> 04:29.032
Now we're cookin'!
现在我们开始做饭了！

04:29.032 --> 04:30.963
Yeah!
是的！

04:34.205 --> 04:35.239
Uh...
呃...

04:39.343 --> 04:40.722
<i>Ah.</i>
<i>啊。</i>

04:49.101 --> 04:50.550
Mmm.
嗯。

04:50.550 --> 04:53.170
Hm.
嗯。

04:53.170 --> 04:54.170
both: Yah!
两人：啊！

04:54.170 --> 04:55.205
Here.
这里。

04:57.826 --> 04:59.791
Aww.
哇。

05:01.412 --> 05:04.619
Hup! Hup! Hup!
哈！哈！哈！

05:06.377 --> 05:07.239
Hmm?
唔？

05:07.239 --> 05:08.963
Ohh-up.
哦，上。

05:08.963 --> 05:10.412
Ha.
哈。

05:22.826 --> 05:24.446
- Huh?
- Demand for nuts is up.
- 啊？
- 对坚果的需求增加。

05:24.446 --> 05:26.757
- Uh...
- So we're increasing supply!
- 呃...
- 所以我们正在增加供应！

05:30.274 --> 05:31.722
- Bah.
- Make way, boy-o.
- 呸。
- 让路，小伙子。

05:31.722 --> 05:33.481
Well, gee, Mr. Krabs,
好吧，哎呀，蟹老板先生，

05:33.481 --> 05:36.757
I think you might be
overwhelming poor Sandy.
我想你可能是
压倒性的可怜的桑迪。

05:36.757 --> 05:37.998
Hmph!
哼！

05:37.998 --> 05:38.998
Ha!
哈!

05:41.619 --> 05:44.101
This here's
the barbecue lunch rush!
这是这里的
烧烤午餐高峰期！

05:45.274 --> 05:46.619
And, uh, here.
还有，呃，这里。

05:46.619 --> 05:48.653
Somebody wants
a Krabby Patty, I guess.
有人想要
我猜是蟹肉饼。

05:48.653 --> 05:50.826
- Hm.
- Now giddyup!
- 嗯。
- 现在头晕目眩！

06:03.446 --> 06:04.929
Whoa!
哇！

06:04.929 --> 06:06.101
Ah!
啊!

06:09.894 --> 06:11.343
Phew!
唷！

06:11.343 --> 06:12.688
All the orders are up.
所有的订单都到齐了。

06:12.688 --> 06:15.170
Yep.
All of 'em.
是的。
他们所有人。

06:15.170 --> 06:17.481
Ooh, that one's mine.
哦，那个是我的。

06:20.101 --> 06:21.377
Mm... perfect!
嗯...完美！

06:21.377 --> 06:22.619
No more wobble.
不再晃动。

06:24.308 --> 06:26.619
Patty.
帕蒂。

06:29.550 --> 06:31.757
Don't you love the new look?
你不喜欢新外观吗？

06:31.757 --> 06:34.688
I'm just here for the nuts.
我只是来找坚果的。

06:37.136 --> 06:39.757
Kowboy Krab's Nut Shack?
Kowboy Krab 的坚果小屋？

06:39.757 --> 06:42.170
Pfft, it's full of nuts,
all right.
噗，里面全是坚果，
好吧。

06:49.170 --> 06:51.826
SpongeBob, hand me them tongs
over there, will ya?
海绵宝宝，把夹子递给我
在那儿，好吗？

06:51.826 --> 06:54.894
I'm busier than a six-legged
horse in tap shoes!
我比六足人还忙
穿踢踏鞋的马！

07:06.860 --> 07:08.688
Ooh!
Thanks, SpongeBob!
哦！
谢谢，海绵宝宝！

07:08.688 --> 07:11.515
Must breathe.
必须呼吸。

07:20.446 --> 07:22.205
Ohh.
哦。

07:23.757 --> 07:25.929
There's gold
in them there nuts!
有金子
他们里面有坚果！

07:25.929 --> 07:27.481
What's in the bags,
Mr. Krabs?
袋子里装的是什么
蟹老板？

07:27.481 --> 07:31.136
Oh, this here's the next
round of barbecue nut orders.
哦，这是下一个
一轮烧烤坚果订单。

07:31.136 --> 07:32.481
Ooh.
哦。

07:32.481 --> 07:34.826
Well, scratch my back
and call me a cactus!
嗯，挠我的背
并叫我仙人掌！

07:34.826 --> 07:36.308
And what about that one?
那那个呢？

07:36.308 --> 07:37.619
Oh, this one?
哦，这个？

07:37.619 --> 07:39.619
This one's full of useless
Krabby Patties.
这个充满了无用的东西
蟹肉饼。

07:39.619 --> 07:42.584
Nobody really wants 'em,
so they're garbage.
没有人真正想要他们，
所以它们是垃圾。

07:45.308 --> 07:47.032
Oh, my!
哦，天哪！

07:47.032 --> 07:48.515
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

07:48.515 --> 07:49.963
Hi, Sandy.
嗨，桑迪。

07:49.963 --> 07:52.550
Just toasting my buns. Heh.
只是烤我的面包。呵呵。

07:52.550 --> 07:55.136
Move over, lad.
You're blocking me trash.
走过去，小伙子。
你挡住了我的垃圾。

07:59.343 --> 08:01.481
Money, money, money, money.
Nuts, nuts, nuts.
钱，钱，钱，钱。
坚果，坚果，坚果。

08:05.481 --> 08:07.653
Uh, SpongeBob?
呃，海绵宝宝？

08:07.653 --> 08:09.481
Are you gonna be okay?
你会没事吗？

08:13.515 --> 08:14.860
Back to work.
返回工作岗位。

08:14.860 --> 08:17.205
That money won't
barbecue itself!
这笔钱不会
烧烤本身！

08:19.826 --> 08:22.170
Ah, I love the smell
of money.
啊，我喜欢这个味道
钱。

08:22.170 --> 08:25.274
Little smokier than usual.
比平时烟味大一点。

08:25.274 --> 08:26.722
Ohh, yeah.
哦，是的。

08:26.722 --> 08:28.308
Huh?
啊？

08:30.791 --> 08:32.929
Mr. Squidward,
what's the holdup?
章鱼哥先生，
有什么阻碍吗？

08:32.929 --> 08:35.722
Why don't you ask
your pitmaster?
你为什么不问
你的坑主？

08:35.722 --> 08:38.032
She stopped barbecuing nuts.
她不再烧烤坚果了。

08:38.032 --> 08:39.860
She what?
她什么？

08:43.688 --> 08:45.722
Land dweller!
陆地居民！

08:45.722 --> 08:47.205
What's the meaning of this?
这有什么意义呢？

08:47.205 --> 08:48.791
Ohh.
哦。

08:48.791 --> 08:50.929
I'm plumb out of nuts.
我已经疯了。

08:50.929 --> 08:53.170
You're plumb out of what?
你是因为什么而铅垂的？

08:53.170 --> 08:55.239
Sorry, Kowboy Krabs.
对不起，Kowboy Krabs。

08:55.239 --> 08:57.963
Looks like you have to find
another way to make your dough.
看来你必须找到
另一种制作面团的方法。

09:00.860 --> 09:02.170
So long, folks!
再见，伙计们！

09:02.170 --> 09:05.101
- Uhh...
- The nut tree's done run dry!
- 呃...
- 坚果树已经干枯了！

09:06.308 --> 09:09.343
Uh, howdy, y'all.
呃，你们好。

09:09.343 --> 09:13.412
I don't reckon we can get no
Sandy's smokin' barbecue nuts
我不认为我们能得到
桑迪的烟熏烧烤坚果

09:13.412 --> 09:15.481
without no Sandy, can we?
没有桑迪，我们可以吗？

09:15.481 --> 09:17.515
Um... no.
嗯...不。

09:17.515 --> 09:20.136
Riot!
暴动！

09:21.860 --> 09:23.481
Yah!
- Whoa!
啊！
- 哇！

09:23.481 --> 09:24.653
Huh?
Aah!
啊？
啊啊！

09:31.205 --> 09:32.550
Huh?
啊？

09:32.550 --> 09:33.791
Hey, everybody!
嘿，大家！

09:33.791 --> 09:36.619
This table's got
that smoky Texas tang!
这张桌子有
德克萨斯州的烟熏汤！

09:42.274 --> 09:44.032
Fascinating.
迷人。

09:44.032 --> 09:46.584
The smoke from Sandy's nuts
has flavored
桑迪坚果冒出的烟
有味道

09:46.584 --> 09:49.757
everything in this restaurant!
这家餐厅的一切！

09:49.757 --> 09:52.101
Chow time!
周时间！

09:54.101 --> 09:55.963
Mmm.
嗯。

09:59.170 --> 10:00.860
No!
Stop it!
不！
停下来！

10:00.860 --> 10:03.343
Me restaurant!
我的餐厅！

10:03.343 --> 10:04.791
No!
不！

10:06.550 --> 10:07.998
Huh?
啊？

10:11.515 --> 10:12.791
Huh?
啊？

10:12.791 --> 10:15.067
Say, that smells delicious.
说吧，味道真香。

10:15.067 --> 10:16.308
Oh, this?
哦，这个？

10:16.308 --> 10:18.791
Oh, it's just a useless
old Krabby Patty.
呵呵，这只是一个无用的东西
老克拉比帕蒂。

10:18.791 --> 10:21.205
A snack without splinters.
没有碎片的零食。

10:21.205 --> 10:22.963
How novel.
多么新颖啊。

10:22.963 --> 10:25.791
Perhaps we could partake
in your patties?
也许我们可以参加
在你的肉饼里？

10:25.791 --> 10:27.412
Oh, hey,
I want some of those.
哦，嘿，
我想要其中一些。

10:29.550 --> 10:30.722
Huh?
啊？

10:30.722 --> 10:32.929
Orders up!
订单上架！

10:34.722 --> 10:36.101
Good news!
好消息！

10:36.101 --> 10:38.826
Trashy Patties are now
double the price!
现在是垃圾馅饼
价格翻倍！

10:41.032 --> 10:41.860
Whoa!
哇！

10:41.860 --> 10:43.239
Not so fast.
没那么快。

10:43.239 --> 10:45.860
I reckon these patties
are on the house.
我认为这些肉饼
都在房子上。

10:45.860 --> 10:47.550
Right, SpongeBob?
对吧，海绵宝宝？

10:47.550 --> 10:48.550
Mm...
毫米...

10:48.550 --> 10:50.412
all: Yeehaw!
全体：耶哈！

10:50.412 --> 10:54.032
I guess we all went
